# Marketing Hub current-code UI audit — 2026-08-06

Scope: read-only inventory of current `dashboard/src/app` (25 page entries, 121 API route entries), shell, provider components, hooks/store, and cited wiki/history. This is local-repository evidence only; it does **not** assert that a route is deployed or operationally observed.

## System shell and entry

| Surface | Route / code | Actual behavior and dependencies | State / risk | Wiki |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Root shell | `app/layout.tsx`, `components/shared/AuthGate.tsx`, `components/layout/Sidebar.tsx` | AuthGate selects landing, customer shell, or operator shell. Sidebar fetches `/api/me`; customer workspace is placed in Zustand `ui-store`. | Implemented locally. `AuthGate` landing claims all 8 text platforms; this must not be read as a Studio-card inventory. | `wiki/ops/session-state.md`, `wiki/decisions/004-social-connect-oauth-not-passwords.md` |
| Customer navigation | `Sidebar.tsx:310-484` | 26 items: 성과, OSMU Studio, 승인 인박스, 발행 캘린더; Social 5; Messaging 3; Video 2; Data 3; Keyword 4; Blog; Images/Videos/Midjourney; Settings. | Existing local IA. Responsive risk: desktop sticky 224px rail; narrow behavior must be browser checked. | `wiki/reference/channel-status.md`, `wiki/product/studio.md` |
| Operator navigation | `Sidebar.tsx` `OperatorSidebar` | Separate Admin shell, customers/OAuth operations; customer workspace cleared. | Implemented locally; no customer routes should mount. | `wiki/ops/operator-token-recovery.md` |
